<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\五島→なつみ.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\デパ地下.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ピザフェア.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ピザの箱.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Aah, I ate and ate! I can't eat anymore!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"In the end, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, you sampled more than a whole portion..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We had come to the pizza fair at Motoki Station, and we enjoyed the many pizzas set out for sampling.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I had wondered what sort of person an Italian chef would be, but one look at his face and I finally understood.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This Italian chef is someone who is on television all the time.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Though an Italian, he wields </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="りゅうちょう">fluent</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> Tsugaru dialect, and he is the man of the hour, setting living rooms roaring with his brisk patter.</STYLE> [TN: Tsugaru: a dialect of Japan's far north, hard for other Japanese]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He always wears a white chef's coat, but the impression he gives is less of a chef than of a variety-show personality.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Still, with this morning's incident, even this chef must be finding it hard going in the air over Motoki-cho today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or so I had thought, but he was a pro, and it showed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">As if to smash the gloomy air apart, he was playing it bright, showing off light patter and a smile.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">With a chef that popular having come, there is no need to say how roaring a success the pizza fair was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And a professional chef is a professional chef. Not only the patter; the pizza was superb as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Drawn by the thriving pizza fair, perhaps, the whole area around us was noisy.</STYLE><PG>
"I got plenty to take home, too, so today's a really good day!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> looked thoroughly satisfied.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">After a murder like that, and she calls it a good day.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> looked thoroughly satisfied, but there was one big problem.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">... how are you going to get that home?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? On my bike, obviously...
{PAUSE ""}
wait... It's not all gonna fit... Haha, what do I do..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> was stuck, and she looked delighted about it.</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
<PG>
"Oops, a call. Sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, hold this."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{MOTION "ピザ移動" "アイテム1" "3" "200" "300" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="2"> said so, and dumped the pizza boxes on me with a thud.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ngh... these are pretty heavy...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, it's someone from my class.
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Yeah, hello? Ah, what's up? Yeah..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At first she was talking happily, but―</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
"Huh? <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> is...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Giddy until a moment before, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">'s voice suddenly changed to a tense </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="こわいろ">tone</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>... <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>... they say she's at Zahha with a suspicious person..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It couldn't be that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had been marked by the culprit and carried off?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But then going to Zahha is strange.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Or else, surely not, compensated dating?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would never do anything like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But it is certain that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is with a suspicious man.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">, could you call </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\なつみ→五島.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it's a call."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"M-Mister...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeees, Goto speaking! What's the matter, </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>! Are you safe!? Are you with a suspicious person right now!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">A suspicious person...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I looked at </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Ahahaha! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">This man</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is a police officer! I was at the park and one thing and another happened, and now I get to hear about the incident!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What the heck, giving me a scare... Damn, those guys and their weird information..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's awfully noisy on your end. Are you out somewhere?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah!<STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE>I've got <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> with me, and now we're at the pizza fair by the station! But I bought too much, and how am I supposed to get it home..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"The moment you hear pizza you lose all judgment... When that happens, you should use the same-day delivery service at the station. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm fairly sure they do it for 500 yen. And don't drag </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> around too much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ooh, just what I'd expect of the genius girl <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE>!<STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE>You're a lifesaver! Thanks!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Still, so I am the one with a suspicious person.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, I had been vaguely feeling eyes on me for a while now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I looked outside the smoking booth, everyone quickly looked away.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mister</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Now then, let's talk about the incident!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I grinned at him from ear to ear.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face was somehow grim.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Now, now, some days are like that, so please don't let it get you down!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"The one you were just talking to...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Haruka Niimura-san<STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh? Yes, that's right... Do you know about </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "50"}
<STYLE ID="6">"So it is, after all... A senior of mine once told me that things were hard at the </STYLE>Niimura-san<STYLE ID="6"> place."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">And so I learned, from the lips of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, who was showing a police officer's face for the first time, that </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="2">'s father was dead.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
